{"id":"n62700-1-11","stage":4,"title":"새하얗다 · 雪白","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62700-1-11-1","ko":"너 왜 얼굴이 새하얗게 질렸니?","zh":"你为什么脸色变得这么苍白啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"얼굴이","meaning":"脸色","explanation":"얼굴：脸色；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"얼굴","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17183","senseId":"3","lemma":"얼굴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼굴이","audio":"/audio/81669bb10178aa2a65c6.mp3"}},{"text":"새하얗게","meaning":"雪白","explanation":"새하얗다：雪白；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"새하얗다","audio":"/audio/5b6ef7b1a91b3c0ac32c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62700","senseId":"1","lemma":"새하얗다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새하얗게","audio":"/audio/47735d0b35b5381d4927.mp3"}},{"text":"질렸니?","meaning":"失色","explanation":"질리다：失色；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"질리다","audio":"/audio/79cfb0b2ef49910bed75.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89291","senseId":"5","lemma":"질리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"질렸니","audio":"/audio/8ca7b7dacbee22820206.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","